O                0.2553064414        0.6170567894        0.3957792443
O                0.2166186853        0.8981522109        0.9390156060
O                0.7833813147        0.8981522109        0.5609843940
O                0.7760198412        0.1030076831        0.0614525323
O                0.2239801588        0.1030076831        0.4385474677

K_POINTS automatic
6 6 6 1 1 1

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
   4.5886900051   0.0000000000  -0.0112230753
   0.0000000000   5.6083227763   0.0000000000
  -0.0600591093   0.0000000000   4.9344688436

HUBBARD {ortho-atomic}
U Mn-3d 4.65
U Co-3d 7.84
